                external library needs - <b>Icon</b>, <b>DismissIcon</b>, <b>ExpandIcon</b> and <b>CollapseIcon</b>.
                Use the <b>Fa</b>, <b>Bi</b> and <b>Css</b> helpers, or pass the classes as a plain string.
            </div>

            <br />

            <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.0.1/css/all.min.css" />

